==================== MULTI-TASK ADMET PROJECTS (FINAL + LINKS) ====================

1. MTAN-ADMET
Paper:
https://chemrxiv.org/doi/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-zhrsk
GitHub:
https://github.com/TeamSuman/MTAN-ADMET
Dataset:
~48k molekuł (zintegrowane publiczne ADMET)
24 endpointy:
- 18 classification
- 6 regression
Opis:
SMILES → CDDD embeddings → MLP → multitask heads
Adaptive loss weighting
Najprostszy realny ADMET multitask (bez graphów)

------------------------------------------------------------

2. ADMET-AI
Paper:
https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11226862/
GitHub:
https://github.com/swansonk14/admet_ai
Dataset:
TDC (Therapeutics Data Commons)
41 datasetów:
- 31 classification
- 10 regression
Opis:
SMILES → graph → D-MPNN (Chemprop)
+ RDKit features (~200)
Dwa modele multitask (classification + regression)
Benchmark SOTA

------------------------------------------------------------

3. MTGL-ADMET
Paper:
https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10654589/
GitHub:
https://github.com/dubingxue/MTGL-ADMET
Dataset:
Public ADMET + MoleculeNet
~10–15 endpointów
Opis:
Graph NN + task gating
Primary + auxiliary task learning
Dynamiczne ważenie tasków

------------------------------------------------------------

4. Multitask GCN (MDPI)
Paper:
https://www.mdpi.com/1420-3049/25/1/44
GitHub:
brak
Dataset:
Physicochemical datasets
~7–10 endpointów (regression)
Opis:
SMILES → graph → GCN → multitask outputs
Najprostszy GNN (2–3 warstwy)

------------------------------------------------------------

5. MTAN (base architecture)
Paper:
https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.10704
GitHub:
https://github.com/lorenmt/mtan
Dataset:
NIE ADMET (vision datasets)
Opis:
Shared backbone + task attention
Architektura multitask (do przeniesienia na ADMET)

------------------------------------------------------------

6. Multi-task ADMET (Quantum + MTL)
Paper:
https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.04601
GitHub:
brak
Dataset:
TDC
13 endpointów (classification)
Opis:
SMILES + quantum descriptors
+ multitask weighting
Najbardziej zaawansowany (QM features)

